{"title":"Ogre","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 35 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=40\">Lv 40 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>13</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=40\" title=\"Pick level 40\"><td><b>40</b></td><td>194</td><td>26.5</td><td>2,000</td><td class=\"muted\">582 · 37.1 · 6,000</td><td>7</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>2</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for this monster yet.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Ogre Den</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 20</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-57\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ogre\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(2)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/ogre-mage\"><img src=\"data/img/ec5ecde5e79f4b9bd162.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Ogre Mage</b><span>Lv 40</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/ogre-traitor\"><img src=\"data/img/ec5ecde5e79f4b9bd162.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Ogre Traitor</b><span>Lv 45</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Ogre: <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\">Ogre Youth</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-gaunt\">Gaunt Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mauler\">Ogre Mauler</a> <span class=\"muted\">(38)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-butcher\">Ogre Butcher</a> <span class=\"muted\">(40)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-charger\">Ogre Charger</a> <span class=\"muted\">(42)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-shaman\">Ogre Shaman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(44)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-elder\">Ogre Elder</a> <span class=\"muted\">(46)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-mountain\">Mountain Ogre</a> <span class=\"muted\">(50)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/ogre-warchief\">Ogre Warchief</a> <span class=\"muted\">(54)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/ec5ecde5e79f4b9bd162.webp\" alt=\"Ogre\"></div><h3>Ogre</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>35 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 35–45)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Ogre</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>152</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>23.8</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1750</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>2</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>13 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}